      "comment": "ALLY'S VOGUE (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing eighth (23.74) in a Grade 5 at this track. Has winning claims on her best figures. ZIPPING TANAKA (3) hit the ground running and was prominent to the turn but faded out of it when 6th at this track in Grade 5 company. Can figure in the finish. REBEL ENERGY (2) struggled in tougher grade last start at Gosford, but prior to that won by 1.5 lengths at Gosford (22.68) beating Big Fingers in a Maiden on October 1. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Cannot be taken lightly. SAMJAI (8) was a surprise last-start placegetter worth considering.",
